        "metadata": {
          "category": "podcast",
          "media": {
            "duration": 85535
          },
          "description": "Stoopkid Stories is your podcast for fun and exciting new stories. Follow seven young, Black characters every episode, as they face a new adventure and listen to them overcome different obstacles, dealing with their friends, family, school, and community. Each story has a lesson and will hopefully spark conversations in households, schools, and playgrounds all over the world.  \n\nSuitable for ages five and up.",
